{"resourceIdentifier":"2876","resourceName":"Muyuan WJZ AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Henan Province","description":"The project introduces new animal waste management systems to treat the manure from 7 swine farms in Nanyang City and Zhumadian City, Henan Province. Each subsidiary swine farm will install one animal waste management system (AWMS), and the manure is treated on site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons. \r\nThe project activity uses flushing system to collect the manure automatically. All the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The solid will be treated in aerobic composting system and the organic fertilizers will be produced, the fertilizer produced in this process will be distributed to local farmers for free and the surplus will be sold in domestic market. The liquid will be treated through anaerobic digestion and the biogas generated during the treatment process will be captured for heat generation. The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid, the effluent will be supplied to the farmers living around free for agriculture irrigation.\r\nIt is estimated that approximately 1,637 tons of animal manure will be handled daily by the AWMS. The biogas released during the anaerobic digestion will be collected and used for heat production. The heat production is estimated to be 657,340GJ. Also, the generated heat will be only used for daily operation of the AWMSs and the 7 swine farms themselves and will not be provided to other users. For conservativeness, baseline emissions from heat generation are neglected.\r\nThe project activity will reduce of GHG in the atmosphere through avoiding methane emissions from anaerobic treatment of swine manure and wastewater. It is estimated that 321,663tCO2e emission reductions will be produced annually.","location":{"latitude":32.869180,"longitude":112.454380},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-12","endExclusive":"2022-09-12","endInclusive":"2022-09-11"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2876"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Muyuan Foods Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"321663"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"09/05/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 15/07/2020 - 14/07/2030"}]}]},{"programCode":"SDVISTA","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Muyuan Foods Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verified"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"321663"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livelihoods"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"FIRST_VERIFICATION_VER_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROGRAM_OBJECTIVE_CODE","values":[{"type":"image","value":"07__AFFORDABLE_AND_CLEAN_ENERGY; 08__DECENT_WORK_AND_ECONOMIC_GRO; 12__RESPONSIBLE_CONSUMPTION_AND; 13__C